---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<header
  class="col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-8 px-8 py-15 md:px-12 lg:fixed lg:right-2/3 lg:mt-0 lg:w-1/3 lg:max-w-md"
>
  <img
    src="/favicon.png"
    alt=""
    width="72"
    height="72"
    class="avatar reveal"
    style="--i: 0"
  />
  <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-1" style="--i: 1">
    <div class="spec text-slate-500">Hi there, I’m</div>
    <h1 class="-mt-1 text-5xl/11 font-bold text-slate-900 md:text-6xl/14">
      Fikri <span class="hidden lg:inline"><br /></span>Achmad
    </h1>
    <div class="text-lg text-slate-500">It’s nice to meet you.</div>
  </div>
  <p class="reveal text-lg text-slate-700" style="--i: 2">
    I build full-stack web apps, and IoT when the work needs to touch hardware.
    Open to both - freelance or full-time. Games are the hobby: Waluh Studio is
    one person, and that person draws the pixels and writes the code.
  </p>
  <div class="reveal flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-700" style="--i: 3">
    <Icon name="tabler:hand-stop" class="text-theme-500 text-xl" />
    <span class="font-medium">Say Hi,</span>
    <a
      href="mailto:developer@fikriachmad.dev?subject=Hi%20from%20the%20internet"
      class="text-theme-500 hover:text-theme-600 underline decoration-theme-300 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-theme-500"
      >developer@fikriachmad.dev</a
    >
  </div>
</header>
